  "body": "Design record for #6061: the Atlas storage growth model (per-source churn x retained versions, marginal bytes via the #6028 span-reuse ratio, hot/cold split, staging modelled separately) projected against the #6019 plan envelope, plus the calibration procedure that turns #6058 ingest-ledger data into per-class retention defaults for the #6026 / #6041 rule engine.\n\nAcceptance mapping (task 13013 packet):\n- Dated design record in doc/ with a doc/README.md index entry; inputs (churn, reuse ratio, retained-version counts, manifest/metadata, index amplification, hot vs cold) and the envelope projection are in sections 2-4, with a worked example.\n- Calibration procedure in section 5: the #6058 ledger fields consumed, weekly-then-monthly cadence, conservative (keep-more) v1 defaults, and cold-tier moves preceding deletions by at least one full retention cycle.\n- Inputs/outputs consumed from #6026/#6041 and #6028 are named explicitly (sections 3 and 5.3) rather than re-defined; the #6043 trigger-plus-class-rule requirement is honoured in section 6.\n- No destructive retention action is enabled by this design (section 6).\n\nRefs #6061. Design only; implementation follow-ons are listed in section 7 of the record.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796728786&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7654&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7654&signature=3d01bc104812bfb9b84c4cd755d6f5a50529b117239d6c5b717ff8e349990490\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7654?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
